# W44-154 micro-bisect variant Z dct32x32 ∈ {1.22, 1.23, 1.24} (2026-05-21)

## Source

- Branch: main
- Parent commit: `1a988fc8` (W44-153 ledger refresh post-W44-148/152)
- Tool: `jxl-encoder/examples/w44_154_dct32x32_micro_bisect.rs`
- Reference encoder: cjxl `0.12.0` (libjxl build at `/home/lilith/work/jxl-efforts/libjxl/build/tools/cjxl`)
- Host: lilith (Ryzen 9 7950X, 128 GB)
